    "detailed_description": "<strong>Automoji</strong> is a Auto-Battle, roguelike, strategy game where you buy, upgrade, and position your Emoji units!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock all 4 packs containing 130+ unique units!<br></li><li>Find and combine the effects of 50+ items!<br></li><li>Plan the best route on your uniquely generated map each run!<br></li><li>Earn XP to unlock new items to find in future runs!<br></li><li>Swap out your units to find endless synergies!<br></li><li>Optimize your formation at the start of each battle! <br></li><li>Fight formations of increasingly difficult enemies! <br></li><li>Power up and combine your units to out-scale your foes!</li></ul><br><strong>Automoji's</strong> OST was composed by Vincent Colavita: the artist behind the soundtracks for games such as Luck be a Landlord, Red Ronin, and many more!<br>Check out Vincent's other work at <br><br><strong>Automoji</strong> is a solo development project by Karl and was fully released after almost a year of Early Access. Please send any QOL or balance feedback via Discord and Twitter. I'm always looking for ways to make Automoji more fun!<br><br>Thank you for playing!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919220/extras/66a6b2c1775a5130deae0702ef51f887.avif?t=1678254249\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Automoji</strong> is a Auto-Battle, roguelike, strategy game where you buy, upgrade, and position your Emoji units!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock all 4 packs containing 130+ unique units!<br></li><li>Find and combine the effects of 50+ items!<br></li><li>Plan the best route on your uniquely generated map each run!<br></li><li>Earn XP to unlock new items to find in future runs!<br></li><li>Swap out your units to find endless synergies!<br></li><li>Optimize your formation at the start of each battle! <br></li><li>Fight formations of increasingly difficult enemies! <br></li><li>Power up and combine your units to out-scale your foes!</li></ul><br><strong>Automoji's</strong> OST was composed by Vincent Colavita: the artist behind the soundtracks for games such as Luck be a Landlord, Red Ronin, and many more!<br>Check out Vincent's other work at <br><br><strong>Automoji</strong> is a solo development project by Karl and was fully released after almost a year of Early Access. Please send any QOL or balance feedback via Discord and Twitter. I'm always looking for ways to make Automoji more fun!<br><br>Thank you for playing!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919220/extras/66a6b2c1775a5130deae0702ef51f887.avif?t=1678254249\" /></div>",
